      <div class="vh-stat"><b>COD</b><span>أو PayPal</span></div>
      <div class="vh-stat"><b>700+</b><span>درهم — عتبة الفولت</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ═══ WHY VAULT ═══ -->
<section class="why" aria-labelledby="why-h">
  <div class="why-in">
    <p class="why-kick rev">شنو كيخلي قطعة Vault؟</p>
    <h2 class="why-h rev" id="why-h">٣ شروط، <em>وحدة كتكفي</em></h2>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card rev"><span class="why-num">01</span><b>براند مطلوب</b><p>Nike، Jordan، Adidas، Karl Kani، Levi's… براندات اللي ثمن الجديد ديالها كيتعدى بكثير، وعندها قيمة فالسوق ولا فالستايل.</p></div>
      <div class="why-card rev"><span class="why-num">02</span><b>ستايل مميز</b><p>مخزون محدود أو قطعة بستايل مميز — التوفر الحقيقي كيبان فصفحة المنتج.</p></div>
      <div class="why-card rev"><span class="why-num">03</span><b>حالة موضحة</b><p>الحالة كتختلف بين القطع، وكنبيّنو غير المعلومات والملاحظات المؤكدة فصفحة المنتج.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% comment %}
  ═══ VAULT ELIGIBILITY ═══

  RULE (owner, 2026-07-31): only products above 700 MAD belong on this page.

  vault_floor is in CENTS, because Liquid's product.price is in cents.
      70000 = 700.00 MAD
  This is the ONLY place the floor is defined. Change it here.

  The floor gates BOTH paths, and that is deliberate:
    a) the `vault` tag — an explicit tag is "eligible for the Vault", NOT an
       override. A tagged piece that gets marked down below the floor drops off
       the page by itself, and climbs back on if it is repriced up. That is why
       the tag is left in place rather than removed: the price decides.
       (This is exactly what happened to the Nike Green Navy Puffer — tagged,
       repriced 799 -> 600, and it must not sit on a page selling "value".)
    b) the pad below — previously unbounded, so untagging cheap pieces did
       nothing: they were the top-priced products, so the pad pulled them right
       back onto a page whose promise is "قطع عندها قيمة أكثر".

  The Vault may therefore render fewer than 6 items — or none. That is correct:
  a thin honest Vault beats a padded one. Raise stock, not the pad.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign vault_floor = 70000 %}
{% assign all_avail = collections.all.products | where: 'available', true %}
{% capture vault_pool %},{% for p in all_avail %}{% if p.tags contains 'vault' and p.price >= vault_floor %}{{ p.id }},{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endcapture %}
{% assign tagged_count = vault_pool | split: ',' | size | minus: 1 %}

{% if tagged_count < 6 %}
  {% assign fallback_sorted = all_avail | sort: 'price' | reverse %}
  {% for p in fallback_sorted limit: 14 %}
    {% if p.price >= vault_floor %}
      {% capture id_marker %},{{ p.id }},{% endcapture %}
      {% unless vault_pool contains id_marker %}
        {% assign vault_pool = vault_pool | append: p.id | append: ',' %}
      {% endunless %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% assign vault_count = vault_pool | split: ',' | size | minus: 1 %}

{% comment %} Collect unique brands for filter chips ─ only from products actually in vault_pool {% endcomment %}
{% assign brand_list = '' %}
{% for p in all_avail %}
  {% capture id_marker %},{{ p.id }},{% endcapture %}
  {% if vault_pool contains id_marker %}
    {% unless brand_list contains p.vendor %}{% assign brand_list = brand_list | append: p.vendor | append: '|' %}{% endunless %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% assign brands = brand_list | split: '|' %}

<!-- ═══ FILTER BAR ═══ -->
<section class="fbar" aria-label="فلتر القطع">
  <div class="fbar-in">
    <div class="fbar-row" role="group" aria-label="حسب النوع">
      <span class="fbar-lbl">النوع</span>
      <button class="fchip on" data-fcat="all">الكل</button>
      <button class="fchip" data-fcat="shoes">سنيكرز</button>
      <button class="fchip" data-fcat="streetwear">ستريت وير</button>
      <button class="fchip" data-fcat="denim">دنيم وجاكيتات</button>
      <button class="fchip" data-fcat="accessories">إكسسوارات</button>
      <div class="fsort">
        <span class="fbar-lbl">رتّب</span>
        <select id="vsort" aria-label="ترتيب القطع">
          <option value="manual">الإختيار ديالنا</option>
          <option value="price-desc">الثمن: الأكبر → الأصغر</option>
          <option value="price-asc">الثمن: الأصغر → الأكبر</option>
          <option value="title">الإسم: A → Z</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% if brands.size > 1 %}
    <div class="fbar-row" role="group" aria-label="حسب البراند">
      <span class="fbar-lbl">البراند</span>
      <button class="fchip on" data-fbrand="all">الكل</button>
      {% for b in brands %}{% if b != blank %}<button class="fchip" data-fbrand="{{ b | escape }}">{{ b }}</button>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ PRODUCT GRID ═══ -->
<main class="vault-main">
  <div class="vault-main-in">
    <p class="vcount"><b id="vcountN">{{ vault_count }}</b> <span>قطعة فالـ Vault</span></p>
    <div class="vgrid" id="vgrid">
      {% for p in all_avail %}
        {% capture id_marker %},{{ p.id }},{% endcapture %}
        {% if vault_pool contains id_marker %}
          {% assign cur = p.selected_or_first_available_variant.price %}
          {% assign cap = p.selected_or_first_available_variant.compare_at_price %}
          {% assign display_title = p.title | split: ' — LBO-' | first | split: ' - LBO-' | first | split: ' – LBO-' | first | split: ' — ' | first %}
          {% assign vault_variant = p.selected_or_first_available_variant %}
          {% assign vault_ticket = p.metafields.lbass.ticket_status.value | default: 'unknown' %}
          {% assign vault_status = p.metafields.lbass.condition_status.value | default: 'unknown' %}
          {% assign vault_inspection = p.metafields.lbass.inspection_status.value %}
          {% assign vault_has_ticket = p.metafields.lbass.has_original_ticket.value %}
          {% assign vault_notes = p.metafields.lbass.condition_notes.value %}
          {% assign vault_defects = p.metafields.lbass.visible_defects.value %}
          {% assign vault_condition = '' %}
          {% assign vault_confirmed = false %}
          {% if vault_inspection == 'inspected_confirmed' %}
            {% if vault_has_ticket == true and vault_status == 'new_with_ticket' %}
              {% if vault_ticket == 'ticket_attached' or vault_ticket == 'ticket_included' %}{% assign vault_condition = 'جديد بالتّيكيت' %}{% assign vault_confirmed = true %}{% endif %}
            {% elsif vault_has_ticket == false and vault_ticket == 'no_ticket' and vault_status == 'new_without_ticket' %}
              {% assign vault_condition = 'جديد بلا تيكيت' %}{% assign vault_confirmed = true %}
            {% elsif vault_has_ticket == false and vault_ticket == 'no_ticket' and vault_status == 'excellent_almost_new' %}
              {% assign vault_condition = 'بحالة ممتازة · شبه جديد' %}{% assign vault_confirmed = true %}
            {% elsif vault_status == 'very_good' %}
              {% assign vault_condition = 'بحالة مزيانة بزاف' %}{% assign vault_confirmed = true %}
            {% elsif vault_status == 'good' %}
              {% assign vault_condition = 'بحالة مزيانة' %}{% assign vault_confirmed = true %}
            {% elsif vault_status == 'needs_note' %}
              {% if vault_notes != blank or vault_defects != blank %}{% assign vault_condition = 'بحالة مزيانة · شوف الملاحظات' %}{% assign vault_confirmed = true %}{% endif %}
            {% endif %}
          {% endif %}
          {% capture vault_one_s %}{% render 'lbass-one-of-one', product: p %}{% endcapture %}{% assign vault_one_s = vault_one_s | strip %}
          {% assign vault_one = false %}{% if vault_one_s == '1' %}{% assign vault_one = true %}{% endif %}
          {% assign vault_promo = false %}
          {% if vault_confirmed and p.metafields.lbass.promo_eligible.value == true %}
            {% if vault_status == 'new_with_ticket' or vault_status == 'new_without_ticket' or vault_status == 'excellent_almost_new' %}{% assign vault_promo = true %}{% endif %}
          {% endif %}
          {% assign cat_slug = 'other' %}
          {% assign tags_str = p.tags | join: ',' | downcase %}
          {% assign type_str = p.product_type | downcase %}
          {% if tags_str contains 'shoes' or tags_str contains 'sneakers' or tags_str contains 'slides' or tags_str contains 'sneaker' or type_str == 'shoes' %}
            {% assign cat_slug = 'shoes' %}
          {% elsif tags_str contains 'jacket' or tags_str contains 'jeans' or tags_str contains 'denim' or tags_str contains 'pants' or tags_str contains 'cargo' or type_str == 'jackets' or type_str == 'jeans' or type_str == 'pants' %}
            {% assign cat_slug = 'denim' %}
          {% elsif tags_str contains 't-shirt' or tags_str contains 'tshirt' or tags_str contains 'hoodie' or tags_str contains 'shirt' or tags_str contains 'streetwear' or type_str == 't-shirts' or type_str == 'hoodies' or type_str == 'sets' %}
            {% assign cat_slug = 'streetwear' %}
          {% elsif tags_str contains ',acc,' or tags_str contains 'accessory' or tags_str contains 'cap' or tags_str contains 'bag' or type_str == 'accessories' %}
            {% assign cat_slug = 'accessories' %}
          {% endif %}
          <div class="lbqa-wrap">
          <a class="vcard rev" href="{{ p.url }}" data-vault-product data-product-id="{{ p.id }}" data-cat="{{ cat_slug }}" data-brand="{{ p.vendor | escape }}" data-price="{{ cur }}" data-title="{{ display_title | escape }}" data-tagged="{% if p.tags contains 'vault' %}1{% else %}0{% endif %}">
            <div class="vc-img">
              {% if p.featured_image %}
                <img src="{{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}" alt="{{ display_title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="600" height="750">
              {% else %}
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%;color:var(--ink-3);font-size:80px;opacity:.35">{% case p.product_type %}{% when 'Jackets' %}🧥{% when 'Jeans' %}👖{% when 'T-Shirts' %}👕{% when 'Shoes' %}👟{% when 'Hoodies' %}🧣{% when 'Accessories' %}🕶{% else %}✦{% endcase %}</div>
              {% endif %}
              <div class="vc-badges">
                {% if p.tags contains 'vault' %}<span class="vc-badge vc-bvault">VAULT</span>{% endif %}
                {% if vault_promo %}<span class="vc-badge vc-bnew">قطعة مختارة</span>{% endif %}
                <span class="vc-badge">{{ vault_condition }}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="vc-info">
              <p class="vc-vendor">{{ p.vendor }}</p>
              <h3 class="vc-title" style="font-weight:500; font-size:14px; min-height:0; margin-bottom:4px;">{{ display_title }}</h3>
              <div style="font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-2); font-weight:500; margin-bottom:12px;">{% unless p.has_only_default_variant %}Size {% for v in p.variants %}{{ v.title }}{% unless forloop.last %}, {% endunless %}{% endfor %} · {% endunless %}{{ vault_condition }}</div>
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; margin-top: 12px;">
                <div style="font-weight:900; font-size:18px; color:var(--ink);">{{ cur | money_without_currency | strip }} د.م.</div>
                <div style="font-size:12px; font-weight:800; border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink); padding-bottom:2px; color:var(--ink);">شوف القطعة</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
          
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="vempty" id="vempty" {% if vault_count > 0 %}style="display:none"{% endif %}>
      <b>ما لقيناش قطع بهاد الفلتر</b>
      <p>جرّب فلتر آخر، أو <a href="/collections/all">شوف الكولكسيون كاملة ←</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

